alert-name-scp096-face = State
alert-desc-scp096-face-base =
    This face... it is vile and hideous. It reflects my current mental and physical state. 
    [bold] As I dwell on it, something inside me whispers... [/bold]
alert-desc-scp096-face-damage =
    { alert-desc-scp096-face-base }
    Let my flesh bleed dust — so long as not a single drop of their memory remains.
alert-desc-scp096-face-idle =
    { alert-desc-scp096-face-base }
    Within this silence lies a universe of torment. They breathe, they laugh... while I smolder in a stifled scream, waiting for a spark.
alert-desc-scp096-face-rage =
    { alert-desc-scp096-face-base }
    I AM THE BURSTING ABSCESS OF THE UNIVERSE! 
    [color=red]LET THEIR SOULS BECOME KINDLING FOR THE ETERNAL PYRE OF MY HATRED![/color]
alert-desc-scp096-face-heating-up =
    { alert-desc-scp096-face-base }
    > FACES BURN IN MY MEMORY <
    Their features sear themselves into my flesh! Every glance of theirs is a nail in the coffin of my peace! [color=red]I WILL TEAR THEM OUT FROM BENEATH MY OWN SKIN![/color]
alert-desc-scp096-face-sleep =
    { alert-desc-scp096-face-base }
    Not sleep. Not rest. This is a gravitational well of absolute, crystallized fury. 
    Soon, it will collapse. And a new Big Bang will be born... [color=red]consisting solely of their screams.[/color]
